# ── Application source is intentionally NOT formatted by Prettier ─────────────
# The UI is written with dense, hand-aligned inline style objects. Running
# Prettier across it would rewrite ~13k lines and destroy that alignment for no
# functional gain, while burying every future diff in noise. Prettier owns the
# config, docs and infrastructure files; ESLint owns correctness in src/.
# Revisit if the styling layer ever moves to CSS modules or a token system.
src/**/*.jsx
src/**/*.js

# Tooling configs use the same dense, comment-heavy style as the source and are
# read far more often than they are edited.
eslint.config.js
vite.config.js
tests/setup.js
